SigmaStreams Player brand assets
================================

The launcher icons and wordmark in this directory are SigmaStreams artwork,
reused with the owner's authorization from the SigmaStreams glossy appearance
v2 collection. These assets replace the upstream Silo logo, wordmark, icons,
and TV banner. No license to the SigmaStreams name or artwork is granted by
the source code license. The application's source remains AGPL-3.0-or-later.

The original Silo project's trademarks remain the property of Silo Media
L.L.C.; see TRADEMARK.md for the upstream policy.
